170
00:22:08,598 --> 00:22:13,838
真夏のJamboree レゲエ砂浜Big Wave
Midsummer Jamboree, reggae, sandy beach, Big Wave!

171
00:22:14,358 --> 00:22:17,758
悪ノリのHeartbeat めっちゃゴリゴリ
Playful heartbeat, super intense!

172
00:22:18,598 --> 00:22:24,118
