Welcome Weekend, scorching hot Jamboree!

173
00:22:24,638 --> 00:22:26,638
暴れまくってイイぜ!!
It's totally fine to go wild!!

174
00:22:27,078 --> 00:22:32,238
冷めないでSummer Dream 濡れたまんまでイッちゃって!!!
Don't let the Summer Dream cool down, go all out while still soaking wet!!!

175
