338
00:50:15,352 --> 00:50:18,692
キミにさようなら
Saying goodbye to you.

339
00:50:19,412 --> 00:50:22,172
今でも青が住んでいる
Blue still dwells within me,

340
00:50:22,632 --> 00:50:25,392
今でも青は住んでいる
Blue still dwells within me.

341
00:50:25,512 --> 00:50:30,892
どんな祈りも言葉も 近付けるのに届かなかった
Though every prayer and word brought me closer, they couldn't reach you.

342
00:50:30,892 --> 00:50:36,592
まるで静かな恋のような 頬伝った夏のような色の中
Like a quiet love, within colors like summer tracing down my cheek,

343
00:50:36,592 --> 00:50:44,392
キミを呪う言葉が ずっと喉の奥に仕かかっている また会えるよねって
the words cursing you are still stuck deep in my throat... "We'll meet again, right?"

344
00:50:44,392 --> 00:50:51,472
子供になれない声 凍りにならない声
A voice that cannot be a child, a voice that won't freeze into ice,

345
00:50:51,472 --> 00:50:57,952
無限に膨らむ隙間の 星の粒のように揺らぎ隙間をこぼれた
Spilling like stardust through the expanding gaps...

346
00:51:10,012 --> 00:51:17,492
Starlight 繋いで 繰り越してく衝動
Starlight, connecting... impulses repeating over and over.

347
00:51:19,352 --> 00:51:25,492
僕らは止まらない きらり輝いてゆけ
We won't stop, shining brightly as we go!

348
00:51:41,032 --> 00:51:45,672
地を踏んだ足取りは 弾んだリズムで
Stepping firmly on the ground with a bouncing rhythm,

349
00:51:45,672 --> 00:51:50,932
キミの心の鐘をまた鳴らす
ringing the bell of your heart once again.

350
00:51:50,932 --> 00:52:01,352
光は線となって やがて形作った キャンバスの上 灯る道 満開 星空が迷いはない
Light became a line, eventually shaping a canvas with a lit path on top, under a full starry sky without any hesitation.

351
00:52:01,352 --> 00:52:10,552
満開 星空が迷いはない また前を向けるから
Under a full starry sky without hesitation, facing forward once more,

352
00:52:10,552 --> 00:52:18,672
Fly again 飛ぶんだ 導かれたこの舞台 いつか聞こえる日まで
Fly again, flying high, guided to this stage until the day I can hear it someday.

353
00:52:20,532 --> 00:52:30,892
空高く掲げた 手を重ね ぶっ壊した限界の その先へ
Holding up our hands high into the sky, layering them, going beyond our broken limits to that place beyond.

354
00:52:41,212 --> 00:52:50,612
思わず涙が こぼれ落ちそうな そんな夜には 連れてくよさあ 一緒に 横柄に差し込む
On nights when tears are about to spill, I'll take you there, come on, together, slipping into...

355
00:52:55,052 --> 00:53:00,832
いつでも届けたい 笑顔になる歌があるから
Wanting to reach you always, because there are songs that make you smile.

356
00:53:06,352 --> 00:53:12,112
Be the star 歌おう 一面染まる金世界
Be the star, let's sing in a golden world dyeing everything.

357
00:53:12,452 --> 00:53:16,252
今もまだ焼き付いて
Still burned into my memory now.

358
00:53:16,252 --> 00:53:26,892
空高く響いた 激情まだ最高潮 昨日よりも駆けるんだ 遠くまで
Resounding high in the sky, passion still at its peak, running further than yesterday, far into the distance.

359
00:53:57,112 --> 00:54:05,252
Fly again 飛ぶんだ 指先触れた結晶
Fly again, flying high, crystals touched by our fingertips.

360
00:54:06,932 --> 00:54:14,272
Be the star なるんだ キミの一等星
