無限の宇宙を流れる星となって キミと僕ら照らす その先へ
Becoming a shooting star flowing through the infinite universe, illuminating you and us, heading beyond that.

363
00:54:38,972 --> 00:54:45,672
超えて 超えて 超えて
Going beyond, beyond, beyond...

364
00:54:58,272 --> 00:55:03,652
Fly again 飛ぶんだ
